  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "babf31978a12dacf",
      "translationZh": "Gemini API Managed Agents：3.6 Flash、钩子及更多功能",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8558d81caad1a2ec",
      "translationZh": "Gemini API 中的 Managed Agents 现在默认使用 Gemini 3.6 Flash。新的环境钩子让你可以在沙箱内阻止工具调用、对其进行静态检查或审计。此外，我们还新增了预算控制、定时触发器和免费层访问权限。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "34bf795db0815904",
      "translationZh": "Google DeepMind 技术团队成员",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "52ce2e9a444c7ed5",
      "translationZh": "Google DeepMind 产品经理",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a21b58ba4c2f878a",
      "translationZh": "你的浏览器不支持音频元素。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9396d34c840bf012",
      "translationZh": "本内容由 Google AI 生成。生成式 AI 尚处于实验阶段",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5d6386607861abdd",
      "translationZh": "Gemini API 中的 Managed Agents 即将获得环境钩子、模型选择和免费层访问权限。这些能力是在我们上一次发布所引入的后台任务和远程 MCP 服务器集成的基础上构建的。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2e96d21d1bca18f7",
      "translationZh": "借助 Gemini Interactions API 中的托管智能体，单次 API 调用即可在隔离的云端沙箱内协调推理、代码执行、软件包安装、文件管理和网页检索。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4f80baab37d17ea3",
      "translationZh": "如果你正在使用 AI 编程助手，可以在终端中输入以下命令，让它能够访问 Interactions API 技能：npx skills add google-gemini/gemini-skills --skill gemini-interactions-api。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6002e09700d7c43d",
      "translationZh": "下面是使用 @google/genai TypeScript/JavaScript SDK 的示例。如需 Python 或 cURL 示例，请查看 Antigravity 智能体文档。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "7b02d9d393a572df",
      "translationZh": "Gemini 3.6 Flash 现已成为默认模型",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "69d6ab82fdc03b5c",
      "translationZh": "antigravity-preview-05-2026 智能体现已默认运行 Gemini 3.6 Flash。无需更改代码。你的下一次交互将自动使用它。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c0851a911f9e0060",
      "translationZh": "你也可以在创建交互或托管智能体时，通过传入 agent_config.model 来显式选择模型。使用 Gemini 3.5 Flash-Lite 可以降低成本，也可以固定使用你偏好的模型。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e5b717267b611d09",
      "translationZh": "支持的模型包括：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "3cb29d8f3d73e4b0",
      "translationZh": "Gemini 3.6 Flash（gemini-3.6-flash，默认）：在推理、编程和工具使用方面表现均衡的模型。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "435ab9cbe485709f",
      "translationZh": "Gemini 3.5 Flash（gemini-3.5-flash）：用于通用智能体工作流的上一代模型。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "636fb8558ff87955",
      "translationZh": "Gemini 3.5 Flash-Lite（gemini-3.5-flash-lite）：Gemini 3.5 系列中延迟最低、成本最低的模型。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "43c690a2169b2503",
      "translationZh": "环境钩子：拦截、检查和审计沙箱内的工具调用",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ae764dc4a4fb7521",
      "translationZh": "环境钩子允许你在智能体于其沙箱内进行的每次工具调用之前或之后，运行自定义脚本。在环境中添加一个 . agents/hooks.json，运行时就会在 pre_tool_execution 或 post_tool_execution 事件发生时执行你的处理程序。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8d4295d953fdec78",
      "translationZh": "matcher 字段支持正则表达式，允许你使用 | 匹配多个工具，或使用 * 匹配所有工具：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "158d4907ac755b23",
      "translationZh": "security-gate 组会在每次 code_execution 或 write_file 调用之前运行 gate.py。如果脚本返回 \"decision\": \"deny\", \"reason\": \"...\"，则会跳过该工具调用，并将拒绝原因传入模型的上下文。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "60c73f6aa8f72896",
      "translationZh": "auto-format 组会在每个工具执行完毕后运行 auto_lint.py，以强制遵循代码风格规范。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "4f2346c7d0b1efcb",
      "translationZh": "钩子还支持 http 类型的处理程序，可直接向外部端点发送 POST 请求。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2751ffb955338ac7",
      "translationZh": "有关完整的 HTTP 钩子定义和失败处理语义，请参阅钩子文档。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
